{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0053_1000_p", "source_sha256": "5b2df1332f07f85579280d13b8f14ddbb8c33b9202a31835b84173f1ccf89e57", "ja": "（外での撮影は無事終了……\n制服姿の環、なかなかいい絵になったな）", "zh": "（户外摄影顺利结束了……\n穿制服的环，拍起来真是美如画啊。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0053_1001_040tam", "source_sha256": "e632f5da5c7cc99539e25065f49d272df9e7ea105c5732f662b898c72e5fbf3a", "ja": "あ、おやぶん。おつかれさま……。\nたまき、今日はなんかすごく恥ずかしかったぞ～……。", "zh": "啊，老大，你辛苦了……\n环总觉得今天好难为情喔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0053_1002_p", "source_sha256": "30776765d28e7e16a6125491423ec9071e2e3f546c6f8816695b1c81a5b776c5", "ja": "環、おかえり。お疲れさま。\nさっそくだけど、今撮った写真、見てみるか？", "zh": "环，欢迎回来，然后你也辛苦了。\n你要马上来看刚才拍的照片吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0053_1003_040tam", "source_sha256": "d8c17e0cd2d1ce050d4badf8baae33e932865732c5d5d255a09266f895e6261a", "ja": "うん……そうだね、おやぶん……。", "zh": "嗯……也好，老大……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0053_1004_p", "source_sha256": "98adb5851cf3d7bf679b6249d46b5150cb463d6ccd2ac3c0b48d3df206f79845", "ja": "環……具合でも悪いのか？　朝からずっと\n撮影続きだったしな、ちょっと休憩するか？", "zh": "环……你身体不舒服吗？\n从早上拍摄到现在也该累了，你要休息一下吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0053_1005_040tam", "source_sha256": "c916c9b8422fde3db2f3136b036bde423aae928ed882073d867440edebd99902", "ja": "なんかね、さっきから力が出てこない……。\nそれに、ちょっとドキドキするぞ……。", "zh": "总觉得啊，从刚才开始就使不上力……\n而且心跳得有点快……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0053_1006_p", "source_sha256": "4ef9fa1bc176b8a826b998b17750613cffb374b5cfb5d14ee26ed4a11b366b2c", "ja": "う～ん、本当に風邪をひいちゃったのかな……\n環、ちょっとおでこさわるぞ。", "zh": "唔～会不会真的感冒了啊……\n环，我摸一下你的额头。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0053_1007_040tam", "source_sha256": "b22b8321f2f8054f4ef0ae4289900b81cafedde2bdcf604313c3c3fc1713893a", "ja": "うん……。", "zh": "嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0053_1008_p", "source_sha256": "2ed4d1a96190439323f142560053eb4e6c142c38a906b3bbae193a084131fba5", "ja": "顔は赤いけど……熱はなさそうだな。\n少し、様子をみてみようか。", "zh": "虽然脸很红……但看来没有发烧呢。\n再稍微观察一下好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0053_1009_040tam", "source_sha256": "ff684b9792c9731fb7aa1d971469fe9f57fdaf10e8d776b02651f8b2d1d78676", "ja": "うん……あのね、おやぶん。\nたまきがヘンなの、スカートはいてからなんだ……。", "zh": "嗯……那个啊，老大。\n环是穿了裙子以后，才开始变奇怪的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0053_1010_040tam", "source_sha256": "b824dec910e0a4278cc0a5cb8b0508f3d14f8300116f3f45b4e7c96c1c0eda34", "ja": "走っちゃダメだし、おしとやかにしなくちゃでしょ？\nそしたらなんか、どんどん顔があつくなってきた……。", "zh": "不是不能奔跑，还必须保持端庄吗？\n照着做以后，环的脸就越来越发烫……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0053_1011_040tam", "source_sha256": "3549c261d526fe2225514e4202f8e308432e11f4f9c200dc9e3464cbdfc6df47", "ja": "ねえ、おやぶん。スカートがすーすーするから、\nたまき、かぜひいちゃったのかな？", "zh": "欸，老大。\n是因为穿裙子凉凉的，环才感冒了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0053_1012_p", "source_sha256": "8e3b97a5485d495e805e7213e8c80d261bbfc6cfa1486cb130352bd94290288d", "ja": "それは、風邪をひいたんじゃなくて……。", "zh": "你那不是感冒……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0053_1013_040tam", "source_sha256": "e1d825864acb2300c0f937c5827cd59ff49c1297974d53460879691abbce3e42", "ja": "ん？", "zh": "嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0053_1014_p", "source_sha256": "e5419504d52c09ddce781038b5b6df62866324fa19cc658f3c7ab5797d989bcf", "ja": "いや、なんでもない。でももう撮影は終わったからな。\n着替えも済んだし、おしとやかにしなくてもいいぞ。", "zh": "不，没什么。不过拍摄已经结束了。\n你也换掉衣服了，可以不用再保持端庄啰。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0053_1015_040tam", "source_sha256": "bd10dcd220f4cf120b10667e8ec8bdd01d6b91fb77bf44a0ef022593ed8c659f", "ja": "ほんと？　……じゃあたまき、走ってくる！\n走ったら、あったかくなるかも！", "zh": "真的吗？……那环要去跑步！\n跑完后搞不好身体就暖了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0053_1016_p", "source_sha256": "b2326b054327931747e32654cbce5c811d764c2273be0a741575599a94a2e45b", "ja": "あっ、環……行っちゃったか。\nまぁでも、元気が出たならよかったかな……。", "zh": "啊，环……走掉了。\n算了，既然她打起精神了就好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
